WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.079 --> 00:00:05.750
Bill Skarsgard gives a terrifying new take
on the shapeshifting Pennywise in the latest

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:10.820
adaptation of Stephen King's best-selling
novel IT about a group of young misfits terrorised

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.969
by an evil presence in their town.

00:00:12.969 --> 00:00:16.770
Yippee-ki-yay, movie lovers, it's Jan here,
and today I'm going to take you behind the

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:21.430
scenes of the new big-screen version of IT
and reveal some freaky facts and intriguing

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:23.660
secrets about the making of the movie.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:26.740
I'm also kicking off a new Funko Pop giveaway
on this video.

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:31.000
All you have to do is be a subscriber to my
